spes: USB step 1, a read-only look at the SM6225 controller, clocks and HS PHY (spesusb=1) (0176)

Draft from the chat session (ROADMAP-TREIBER.md). Checked 2026-11-17 against the spesn live FDT:
gcc clock-controller@1400000, gdsc@141a004, ssusb@4e00000 (core_base 0x100000), dwc3@4e00000
(0xe000), hsphy@1613000 qcom,usb-hsphy-snps-femto (0x110, param-override-seq 0x61/0x6c 0x08/0x70
0x2d/0x74), and against Xiaomi gcc-khaje.c (lineage-24.0): CBCR offsets 0x1a010 0x1a014 0x1a018
0x1a080 0x1a084 0x1d008 0x9f000, all BRANCH_HALT. Writes nothing. Not run on hardware yet.
---
